    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2316640/extras/0efd5d5f6ee30cffd9273b494be3a54c.avif?t=1753924884\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you'll play as a cat engineer and travel to different countries such as Hong Kong, Taiwan, Egypt, and more, each with its unique house styles and layouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2316640/extras/5f58df50af89ba38a3dbb8debb3f4a3f.poster.avif?t=1753924884\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2316640/extras/5f58df50af89ba38a3dbb8debb3f4a3f.webm?t=1753924884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2316640/extras/5f58df50af89ba38a3dbb8debb3f4a3f.mp4?t=1753924884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONNECT CABLE TO LIGHT THE WORLD UP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place and remove connection to make every house light up. But, be careful and don't overload the electricity, each building would have different maximum supply.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2316640/extras/2306d1220c11e6c59a7b7345272ca0fe.avif?t=1753924884\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >120+ PUZZLE TO COMPLETE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main levels will take you through around the world, you can feel relax and enjoy the scenery during the puzzle. The puzzle will burn you brain even you smart like the catgineer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2316640/extras/cac43d69092ffc2971b10a62e3fbe4d5.avif?t=1753924884\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SPECIAL MECHANICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use mutiplier can mutiply the eletricity to the building. You can transmission the power by tunnel. Redirect the electricity by using redirector, and tons of feature and spacial mechnics in the puzzle. Bring the light to everyone!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2316640/extras/3a70fe6942e0324e6862f71d9ba06a1d.avif?t=1753924884\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHOLESOME VIBES IN FULL OF GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The puzzles are difficult but the vibe is wholesome, we have the collection comic book after finish each world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2316640/extras/0efd5d5f6ee30cffd9273b494be3a54c.avif?t=1753924884\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you'll play as a cat engineer and travel to different countries such as Hong Kong, Taiwan, Egypt, and more, each with its unique house styles and layouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2316640/extras/5f58df50af89ba38a3dbb8debb3f4a3f.poster.avif?t=1753924884\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2316640/extras/5f58df50af89ba38a3dbb8debb3f4a3f.webm?t=1753924884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2316640/extras/5f58df50af89ba38a3dbb8debb3f4a3f.mp4?t=1753924884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONNECT CABLE TO LIGHT THE WORLD UP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place and remove connection to make every house light up. But, be careful and don't overload the electricity, each building would have different maximum supply.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2316640/extras/2306d1220c11e6c59a7b7345272ca0fe.avif?t=1753924884\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >120+ PUZZLE TO COMPLETE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main levels will take you through around the world, you can feel relax and enjoy the scenery during the puzzle. The puzzle will burn you brain even you smart like the catgineer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2316640/extras/cac43d69092ffc2971b10a62e3fbe4d5.avif?t=1753924884\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SPECIAL MECHANICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use mutiplier can mutiply the eletricity to the building. You can transmission the power by tunnel. Redirect the electricity by using redirector, and tons of feature and spacial mechnics in the puzzle. Bring the light to everyone!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2316640/extras/3a70fe6942e0324e6862f71d9ba06a1d.avif?t=1753924884\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHOLESOME VIBES IN FULL OF GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The puzzles are difficult but the vibe is wholesome, we have the collection comic book after finish each world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "This is a numerical puzzle game with no text, only images and level designs. Click, think, figure out the usage of items, and solve 120+ power supply puzzle.",
